# This directory must contain the following TTF font files for server-side PDF rendering.
# Download and commit each file before deploying:
#
#   Inter.ttf            — https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Inter
#   Roboto.ttf           — https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Roboto
#   Lato.ttf             — https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Lato
#   Merriweather.ttf     — https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Merriweather
#   OpenSans.ttf         — https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Open+Sans
#   PlayfairDisplay.ttf  — https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Playfair+Display
#   Montserrat.ttf       — https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Montserrat
#
# All fonts are licensed under the SIL Open Font License (OFL).
# PDFKit loads these at render time — zero external network dependency.
